<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU,Freepages seal joint venture.</title>
<headline>VNU,Freepages seal joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Wednesday it and Britain's Freepages Group Plc had finalised the setting up of a 50-50 joint venture which was announced last December.</p>
<p>Freepages already operates a national toll-free interactive information service in the UK which consumers can access through their telephones or the Internet. The new joint venture will introduce the same concept in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>&quot;Both parties will jointly invest a total of about 40 million guilders (in the project) over the next three years,&quot; VNU said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
